(property "Description" " | design | Series RC damping branch, parallel to main100uF. Not in DC receiver power path.; 1210 package for the 0.5 W rating, as for the ≥0.5 W E4 R44xx bleeds; a standard 0603 part is only about 0.1 W. Startup charge of C512 dissipates at most ½×220 uF×(5 V)² ≈ 2.75 mJ in R512; check it against the chosen part's single-pulse curve." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
