(property "Description" "Functional display assembly; HDMI contact names reflect standard Type-A. DC_POS and TP_* are logical labels until exact board connectors are inspected. | module | DC only from protected DISP12, never LAB5. Touch USB VBUS conductor absent. A USB-C touch cable is acceptable only if actual pinout and no-VBUS enumeration are validated. KEY/backlight internal connectors omitted pending exact received board; no undocumented pin numbers invented." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
