(rectangle (start 271.78 152.4) (end 408.94 180.34) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 170 0 0 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid 1fbc8e50-2de3-5725-9a3b-28bba6a282d9))
(text "E5-04 — OPEN, блокує випуск — STACK §5.1 (VBUS RTL-A, HF+); §8 (TPS2553DBVR-1 п. 2–3)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 273.05 153.67 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 170 0 0 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 98530b7b-bd36-5be0-b68c-3897e77edf3b))
(text "Current-setting resistors R501 (RTL-A), R509 (HF+), R514 (T7) and R553 (IMU pack, U553) are engineering\nstarting values (RILIM TBD); STACK §5.1 fixes only the rule 1.5–2× measured current. No measured device\nsteady/startup currents or hot-corner proof.\nВорота (стенд): Measure current/inrush; set the RTL-A/HF+/T7 limits to 1.5–2× the measured current as STACK\n§5.1 requires; confirm HF+ minimum startup ≥0.75 A. Run the STACK §8 TPS2553DBVR-1 item 3 inrush test on\nlatching U503 (HF+ LC 100 µH/100 µF + 220 µF damper) at final RILIM; only if it latches, fit TPS2553DBVR\n(constant-current) on this channel alone. Retry/latch test at all battery states; scope LC overshoot. IMU pack\nbranch (R-E5-08): measure the pack supply current at the J504 lead (start-up and streaming) and set R553 to\n1.5-2x (start 88.7k, 265-339 mA); short the far end of the 2 m cable and confirm U553 limits without latching,\nrecovers after the short is removed and LAB5 does not droop below the E1-05 limits." (at 273.05 155.77 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 7ca5a27d-da8a-581b-ae66-94dd8689d338))
(rectangle (start 271.78 182.88) (end 408.94 193.04) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 0 60 150 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid e0e8d639-7c7b-558e-8194-b1499ff6c658))
(text "N-E5-01 — примітка — STACK §5.1 (VBUS RTL-A); §8 (TPS2553DBVR-1 п. 2–3)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 273.05 184.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 0 60 150 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid b34a4cb7-9004-5d45-a7c9-530ed88c59be))
(text "R501 = RILIM TBD (старт 43.2k 1%, 0.544–0.673 A). STACK для VBUS RTL-A задає лише правило RILIM = 1.5–2×\nвиміряного струму; номінал STACK є тільки для порту LAB (R505 34.8k). Ворота: E5-04." (at 273.05 186.25 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 7edb8dab-2e06-5e35-a4f8-77fc5fa2bd75))
